    rdfs:comment "1.1.0 adds the concepts that the chapter's text uses but never explains (keywords, lambda expressions, nested functions, module functions, positional arguments, frames and stack inspection, recursion, namespaces, name resolution, symbol tables, the nonlocal statement, the exception object, the traceback, the exception hierarchy, the short programs and their tools, annotations, naming and comments) and rewrites the text of every concept in full paragraphs; the existing concept identifiers are kept, so MINOR."@en ;
